==Battleground==
*5 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3.33~8.33 seconds<sup>100f~250f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Imperator Sael]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Use any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

